OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for station scheme beset
OL,4,Aby roadwork delays?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter three years of chaos and delay, a
OL,7,Fkey route in the centre of Oxford
OL,8,Ffinally reopened in the early hours of
OL,9,FSunday morning.
OL,11,FThe Botley Road, to the west of the
OL,12,Fcity, first closed in April 2023 for
OL,13,Fwhat was initially planned to be just
OL,14,Fsix months.
OL,16,FThe much-maligned work makes up just
OL,17,Fone part in a larger Network Rail
OL,18,Fproject to modernise and increase the
OL,19,Fcapacity of Oxford Railway Station -
OL,20,Fwhich is the fourth busiest in the
OL,21,Fsouth-east (not including London
OL,22,Fterminus).
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
